// A seat's open play carried across its protocol's evolution: the moves a
// seat has made so far ride forward along the simulation to the widened
// protocol, as a complete run does (`./seat-evolution.gandr`), and stay open
// there, the seat's next move still owed (Gay and Hole, _Subtyping for
// Session Types in the Pi Calculus_, doi:10.1007/s00236-005-0177-z).

// The seat's protocol, its messages and the widening.
import "./seat-evolution.gandr" ;

// The open play `reporting`: the seat took its task and reported, its next
// move the offer to go on or retire.
import "./seat-prefix.gandr" ;

/// An open play ridden forward along the simulation (#1318).
@[ checks ]
def carried(play : Prefix(Seat.SeatEnd)) -> -F Prefix(Evolution.SeatEnd′) {
  ride(\X. Prefix(X), Evolution.sub, play)
}

/// The open play ridden forward: the record is unchanged, still open.
@[ runs("recorded(received(\"task\"), selected(report), sent(\"progress\"))") ]
def upgraded() -> -F Prefix(Evolution.SeatEnd′) { carried(reporting) }
